  "translation": [
    "Today is Sunday, and the weather is nice. It's already ten o'clock, and Xiaoming is still sleeping. His mom says, \"Xiaoming, get up!\" Xiaoming says, \"I'm very tired. Let me sleep a little longer.\" His mom says, \"If you get up, you can have breakfast.\" Ten minutes later, Xiaoming gets up. He wants to eat bread, but his mom has made eggs and rice. He says, \"I don't like rice.\" His mom says, \"The rice is very good. Have a little.\" He still doesn't want to eat it. His mom laughs and says, \"Then let's go to the supermarket and buy some bread. The supermarket is just up ahead, very close.\" Xiaoming is very happy."
  ],
